00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:06,260
Okay.
好的。

175
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:17,220
They are needy, they are jumpy, and you can't tell what they are
他們很需要幫助，他們很神經質，你無法分辨他們是什麼

176
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:19,340
thinking, and that scares me a little bit.
思考，這讓我有點害怕。

177
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:22,400
Right, they are scary.
沒錯，他們很可怕。

178
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:23,200
Ah!
啊!

179
00:08:23,380 --> 00:08:26,040
She just ate a treat out of my hand!
她剛剛從我手中吃了一頓飯！

180
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,020
So, you're not allergic?
那你不過敏嗎？

181
00:08:30,260 --> 00:08:32,320
I mean, does that mean you're not allergic to wool either?
我的意思是，這是否意味著你也不對羊毛過敏？

182
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:34,640
You bought me a pink turtleneck sweater.
你買了一件粉紅色高領毛衣給我。

183
00:08:36,299 --> 00:08:37,780
The guy in the catalog pulled it off.
目錄中的那個人成功了。

184
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:39,520
Wait a minute.
等一下。

185
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,200
Do you not like all dogs?
你不喜歡所有的狗嗎？

186
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,460
I mean, not even puppies?
我是說，連小狗都沒有？

187
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:43,720
Is there a puppy here?
這裡有一隻小狗嗎？

188
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,040
You don't like puppies?
你不喜歡小狗？

189
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:48,920
Okay, you are new.
好吧，你是新人。

190
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:57,100
Look, Shannon, I told you, never tell anyone about this dog thing.
聽著，夏農，我告訴過你，永遠不要告訴任何人關於狗的事情。

191
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:59,420
It's like Ross not liking ice cream.
就像羅斯不喜歡冰淇淋一樣。

192
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:02,400
You don't like ice cream?
你不喜歡冰淇淋嗎？

193
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,620
It's too cold!
太冷了！

194
00:09:05,660 --> 00:09:08,380
Okay, just the dogs make me a little uncomfortable.
好吧，只是狗讓我有點不舒服。

195
00:09:08,820 --> 00:09:09,480
Where's my key?
我的鑰匙在哪裡？

196
00:09:11,060 --> 00:09:13,000
Now, I don't want to say this, I don't want you guys to
現在，我不想說這個，我不想讓你們說

197
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,900
hate me, but I don't think I can be around that dog anymore.
恨我，但我想我不能再跟那隻狗在一起了。

198
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:17,500
Okay?
好的？

199
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:20,180
So, either the dog goes, or I go.
所以，要嘛狗走，要嘛我走。

200
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:28,830
Oh, my God!
我的天啊！

201
00:09:33,470 --> 00:09:35,650
How can I not get this?
我怎麼得不到這個呢？

202
00:09:35,810 --> 00:09:37,010
I'm a college professor.
我是大學教授。

203
00:09:37,190 --> 00:09:38,750
I got $14.50 on my SATs.
我的 SAT 成績為 14.50 美元。

204
00:09:39,510 --> 00:09:43,250
$12.50. Damn, I forgot you were here.
12.50 美元。該死，我忘了你在這裡。

205
00:09:44,730 --> 00:09:47,370
All right, we're going to take clunkers to Ross's.
好吧，我們要把舊車帶到羅斯家去。

206
00:09:47,470 --> 00:09:48,230
We'll be back in a minute.
我們一會兒就會回來。

207
00:09:48,610 --> 00:09:50,470
Oh, wait, before you guys go, can I just ask you a question?
哦，等等，在你們離開之前，我可以問你們一個問題嗎？

208
00:09:50,850 --> 00:09:51,070
Yeah.
是的。

209
00:09:51,450 --> 00:09:54,370
Um, when a guy breaks up with his girlfriend, what is an appropriate
嗯，當一個男人和他的女朋友分手時，什麼是合適的

210
00:09:54,370 --> 00:09:57,450
amount of time to wait before you make a move?
採取行動之前需要等待多久？

211
00:09:57,750 --> 00:09:59,750
Oh, I'd say about a month.
哦，我想說一個月左右。

212
00:10:00,090 --> 00:10:00,430
Really?
真的嗎？

213
00:10:00,730 --> 00:10:01,810
Let's say three to four.
就說三到四個吧。

214
00:10:02,290 --> 00:10:02,790
Half hour.
半小時。

215
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:08,030
Interesting.
有趣的。

216
00:10:09,470 --> 00:10:11,350
When it's your assistant, I would say never.
如果是你的助理，我會說永遠不會。

217
00:10:11,350 --> 00:10:14,910
All right, Rach, the big question is, does he like you?
好吧，瑞秋，最大的問題是，他喜歡你嗎？

218
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:15,850
Right?
正確的？

219
00:10:15,930 --> 00:10:18,730
Because if he doesn't like you, this is all a moo point.
因為如果他不喜歡你，這就是一個問題。

220
00:10:20,810 --> 00:10:21,110
Huh.
呵呵。

221
00:10:21,610 --> 00:10:22,930
A moo point?
哞點？

222
00:10:25,830 --> 00:10:26,310
Yeah.
是的。

223
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:27,930
It's like a cow's opinion.
這就像牛的意見一樣。

224
00:10:29,230 --> 00:10:29,410
You know?
你知道？

225
00:10:29,890 --> 00:10:31,570
It just doesn't matter.
沒關係。

226
00:10:34,950 --> 00:10:35,670
It's moo.
是哞。

227
00:10:42,830 --> 00:10:45,050
Have I been living with him for too long or did that all
是我和他一起生活太久了還是都這麼做了

228
00:10:45,050 --> 00:10:45,730
just make sense?
有道理嗎？

229
00:10:47,450 --> 00:10:48,650
Please don't listen to Joey.
請不要聽喬伊的話。

230
00:10:49,010 --> 00:10:49,170
Okay?
好的？

231
00:10:49,610 --> 00:10:50,430
Look at him.
看看他。

232
00:10:51,110 --> 00:10:52,510
He's obviously depressed.
他顯然很沮喪。

233
00:10:52,970 --> 00:10:53,930
He's away from his family.
他遠離了家人。

234
00:10:54,050 --> 00:10:55,330
He's spending Thanksgiving with strangers.
他正在和陌生人一起過感恩節。

235
00:10:55,450 --> 00:10:57,430
What he needs right now is for you to be his friend.
他現在需要的是你成為他的朋友。

236
00:10:58,130 --> 00:10:58,870
Oh, you're right.
哦，你是對的。

237
00:10:59,110 --> 00:10:59,830
I'm sorry.
對不起。

238
00:11:00,010 --> 00:11:00,490
Thank you.
謝謝。

239
00:11:00,930 --> 00:11:01,810
Okay, that's what I'm going to do.
好吧，這就是我要做的。

240
00:11:02,010 --> 00:11:02,410
Fine.
美好的。

241
00:11:02,650 --> 00:11:03,690
Take their advice.
聽取他們的建議。

242
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:06,330
No one ever listens to me.
從來沒有人聽我說話。

243
00:11:06,330 --> 00:11:09,490
When the package is this pretty, no one cares what's inside.
當包裝如此漂亮時，沒人會在乎裡面裝的是什麼。

244
00:11:24,230 --> 00:11:26,470
Okay, I'm keeping my end of the deal.
好吧，我遵守協議。

245
00:11:27,370 --> 00:11:28,650
Why is the dog still here?
狗怎麼還在這裡？

246
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:30,810
We're leaving.
我們要走了。

247
00:11:32,190 --> 00:11:32,510
Okay.
好的。

248
00:11:33,370 --> 00:11:34,090
Bye-bye.
再見。

249
00:11:34,330 --> 00:11:34,650
Bye-bye.
再見。

250
00:11:36,290 --> 00:11:37,870
I can pull this off, right?
我可以完成這個任務，對嗎？

251
00:11:42,170 --> 00:11:47,490
How are you holding up?
你還好嗎？

252
00:11:48,410 --> 00:11:49,190
Not bad.
不錯。

253
00:11:49,350 --> 00:11:49,570
Yeah.
是的。

254
00:11:50,170 --> 00:11:52,570
I'm sorry about your girlfriend, but...
我對你女朋友的事感到抱歉，但是...

255
00:11:53,770 --> 00:11:55,250
So are you guys together a long time?
那你們在一起很久了嗎？

256
00:11:56,150 --> 00:11:57,390
A year, on and off.
一年，斷斷續續。

257
00:11:58,090 --> 00:11:59,830
I kind of thought we'd end up together.
我以為我們最終會在一起。

258
00:12:00,470 --> 00:12:01,470
I don't anymore.
我不再這樣了

259
00:12:01,830 --> 00:12:02,830
Now that she broke up with you?
現在她跟你分手了？

260
00:12:03,090 --> 00:12:03,310
Yeah.
是的。

261
00:12:03,430 --> 00:12:03,590
Yeah.
是的。

262
00:12:06,310 --> 00:12:07,030
It's weird.
很奇怪。

263
00:12:07,390 --> 00:12:10,490
I always used to assume that I would meet someone and fall in
我總是以為我會遇到一個人並陷入其中

264
00:12:10,490 --> 00:12:13,410
love and be happy and that all that was just a given.
愛並快樂，而這一切都是既定的。

265
00:12:14,070 --> 00:12:15,810
But lately it's like, what if it's not?
但最近好像，如果不是呢？

266
00:12:16,890 --> 00:12:17,850
Do you ever have that feeling?
你有過這樣的感覺嗎？

267
00:12:18,910 --> 00:12:19,270
No.
不。

268
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:21,270
Yeah.
是的。

269
00:12:22,950 --> 00:12:23,690
All the time.
一直以來。

270
00:12:23,950 --> 00:12:24,310
Constantly.
不斷地。

271
00:12:24,450 --> 00:12:25,010
It's terrifying.
太可怕了。

272
00:12:25,810 --> 00:12:29,010
But you know, then I figure it has to work out.
但你知道，然後我認為事情一定會成功。

273
00:12:29,930 --> 00:12:30,290
Why?
為什麼？

274
00:12:32,090 --> 00:12:32,910
Because it has to.
因為它必須這樣做。

275
00:12:34,690 --> 00:12:36,530
You really have all the answers, don't you?
你真的已經有了所有的答案，不是嗎？

276
00:12:36,670 --> 00:12:37,270
Yeah, I know, I do.
是的，我知道，我知道。

277
00:12:37,330 --> 00:12:37,730
I really do.
我真的這麼做。

278
00:12:39,730 --> 00:12:40,890
Hey, thanks for talking to me.
嘿，謝謝你跟我說話。

279
00:12:41,610 --> 00:12:41,990
Come on.
快點。

280
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:42,730
What are bosses for?
老闆是做什麼用的？

281
00:12:43,790 --> 00:12:44,250
Hug it out.
抱抱它出來。

282
00:12:46,750 --> 00:12:48,650
All right, he likes you back.
好吧，他也喜歡你。

283
00:12:49,990 --> 00:12:50,690
See that?
看到了嗎？

284
00:12:51,470 --> 00:12:53,150
Told you you should go for it.
告訴過你應該去爭取。

285
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:55,390
What?
什麼？

286
00:13:00,140 --> 00:13:01,000
Street noise?
街道噪音？

287
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:02,020
Drowned any of that out?
淹沒其中的任何一個嗎？

288
00:13:03,260 --> 00:13:03,780
No?
不？

289
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:04,740
All right, I'll see you later.
好吧，稍後見。

290
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:05,280
Okay.
好的。

291
00:13:08,860 --> 00:13:09,960
What did Joey say?
喬伊說什麼？

292
00:13:10,540 --> 00:13:11,540
I like you back?
我又喜歡你了？

293
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:13,980
Yeah, you know, well, see...
是的，你知道，好吧，看...

294
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:20,320
Joey knows that I'm very insecure about my back.
喬伊知道我對自己的背部非常沒有安全感。

295
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:27,480
And you were hugging me, so obviously you are not repulsed by it.
而且你還擁抱著我，所以顯然你並不排斥它。

296
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:27,780
Yeah.
是的。

297
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:32,320
Wait a minute, that doesn't make any sense.
等一下，這沒有任何意義。

298
00:13:32,420 --> 00:13:32,620
No?
不？

299
00:13:36,300 --> 00:13:37,060
All right.
好的。

300
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:38,680
Here's the truth.
這是事實。

301
00:13:39,560 --> 00:13:42,340
Joey said what he said, because...
喬伊之所以這麼說，是因為…

302
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:45,980
I'm attracted to you.
我被你吸引了。

303
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:48,240
Wow.
哇。

304
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:49,940
Yeah, I admit it.
是的，我承認。

305
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:55,620
I have a crush on you, and I know that's crazy, because we
我迷戀你，我知道這很瘋狂，因為我們

306
00:13:55,620 --> 00:13:57,680
work together, and nothing could ever happen.
一起努力，就不會發生什麼事。

307
00:13:57,800 --> 00:14:00,560
And the last thing I want to do is to freak you out
我最不想做的就是嚇到你

308
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:02,600
or make you feel uncomfortable.
或讓你感到不舒服。

309
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:07,100
Which is why it would be really great if you said something right
這就是為什麼如果你說得對的話那就太好了

310
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:07,580
about now.
大約現在。

311
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:10,160
Oh my God.
我的天啊。

312
00:14:10,820 --> 00:14:12,280
Those guys are stealing my car.
那些傢伙正在偷我的車。

313
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:12,760
What?
什麼？

314
00:14:13,700 --> 00:14:15,440
Right there, that's my car.
就在那裡，那是我的車。

315
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:16,120
Oh.
哦。

316
00:14:16,420 --> 00:14:16,800
Hey!
嘿！

317
00:14:17,180 --> 00:14:18,600
Okay, well, that's going to take one minute.
好吧，這需要一分鐘。

318
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:20,920
Do you have anything else you want to get off your chest?
還有什麼想吐露的嗎？

319
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:23,240
I can't believe this.
我簡直不敢相信這一點。

320
00:14:23,260 --> 00:14:25,240
Wait, we still have time to talk in there.
等等，我們還有時間去那裡談談。

321
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:27,160
They're not even in the car yet.
他們甚至還沒上車。

322
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:28,020
Oh, look, there they go.
哦，看，他們走了。

323
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:28,240
Okay.
好的。

324
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:32,780
Okay, Phoebe, we should probably go back now.
好吧，菲比，我們現在應該回去了。

325
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,560
Please don't leave me, I'll be lonely.
請不要離開我，我會很孤單。

326
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:38,400
Stop it.
停止吧。

327
00:14:38,540 --> 00:14:38,960
Stop.
停止。

328
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:40,640
Okay, let's go.
好吧，我們走吧。

329
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:42,020
Come on, we can be strong.
加油，我們可以堅強。

330
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:42,600
Yeah, okay.
是啊，好吧。

331
00:14:46,020 --> 00:14:48,040
Oh my God, did you hear that?
天哪，你聽到了嗎？

332
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:49,020
She said Monica!
她說莫妮卡！

333
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:52,520
I can't leave her.
我不能離開她。

334
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:55,480
You know, if you want, we could sneak the dog back in and
你知道，如果你願意，我們可以把狗偷偷帶回來

335
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,420
Chandler wouldn't even know.
錢德勒甚至不知道。

336
00:14:56,860 --> 00:14:57,860
That's not going to work.
那是行不通的。

337
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:01,280
I had that dog there for three days and Chandler had no idea.
我把那隻狗放在那裡三天了，錢德勒對此一無所知。

338
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,440
He's not so smart.
他沒那麼聰明。

339
00:15:02,820 --> 00:15:05,140
Hey, I didn't know either.
嘿嘿，我也不知道。

340
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:09,420
Yeah, but you kind of knew that something was going on, didn't you?
是的，但你知道有些事情正在發生，不是嗎？

341
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:11,340
Yeah, I knew.
是的，我知道。

342
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:18,940
Where's Chandler?
錢德勒在哪裡？

343
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,080
Here I am.
我在這裡。

344
00:15:21,220 --> 00:15:22,340
Wash your hands!
洗手！

345
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,600
How did you know?
你怎麼知道的？

346
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:33,440
Hey, what's she doing back here?
嘿，她回來做什麼？

347
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:35,400
Relax, Ross, she's not made of ice cream.
放鬆點，羅斯，她不是冰淇淋做的。

348
00:15:37,580 --> 00:15:41,280
Hey, look, Phoebe, I laid out the states geographically.
嘿，看，菲比，我在地理上列出了各州。

349
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:43,040
No, we don't really have time for this right now, okay?
不，我們現在真的沒有時間，好嗎？

350
00:15:43,060 --> 00:15:44,800
We have to keep Chandler away from my bedroom.
我們必須讓錢德勒遠離我的臥室。

351
00:15:45,100 --> 00:15:46,140
Yeah, but look what I did.
是的，但看看我做了什麼。

352
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:48,380
See, this is exactly what we do not have time for.
看，這正是我們沒有時間做的事情。

353
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:54,260
Where's Monica?
莫妮卡在哪裡？

354
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:55,360
In Phoebe's room.
菲比的房間裡。

355
00:15:55,420 --> 00:15:56,320
You can't go in there.
你不能進去那裡。

356
00:15:57,260 --> 00:15:57,620
Why not?
為什麼不呢？

357
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:02,040
Monica's crying.
莫妮卡哭了。

358
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:08,160
She's very upset about this whole clunkers thing.
她對這整件舊車的事情感到非常不安。

359
00:16:08,500 --> 00:16:10,180
Well, I should go in there.
嗯，我應該進去看看。

360
00:16:10,180 --> 00:16:11,080
No, no.
不，不。

361
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:14,500
No, she doesn't want to see you right now.
不，她現在不想見你。

362
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:17,120
Why not?
為什麼不呢？

363
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:18,680
Because you sent away the dog.
因為你把狗送走了。

364
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,200
That's ridiculous.
這太荒謬了。

365
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:22,000
Oh, is it?
哦，是嗎？

366
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:22,540
Is it?
是嗎？

367
00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:29,140
Look, when Monica and I were kids, we had a dog named Rover.
聽著，當莫妮卡和我還是個孩子的時候，我們養了一隻名叫羅弗的狗。

368
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:33,800
And one day, my dad decides he doesn't like dogs.
有一天，我爸爸決定不喜歡狗。

369
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:40,400
So Monica and her friend, Phyllis, take away the dog.
於是莫妮卡和她的朋友菲利斯把狗帶走了。

370
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:42,560
And that was the last time we ever saw him.
那是我們最後一次見到他。

371
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:43,200
Don't you see?
你沒看到嗎？

372
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:45,860
This is just like that.
就是這樣。

373
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:49,660
Only with a few details changed.
僅更改了一些細節。

374
00:16:53,060 --> 00:16:54,720
Okay, I'm in my sweatpants.
好吧，我穿著運動褲。

375
00:16:55,620 --> 00:16:56,660
Bring on the food.
把食物端上來。

376
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,400
What's the matter?
怎麼了？

377
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:04,980
Monica's all upset because I sent clunkers away.
莫妮卡很不高興，因為我把舊車送走了。

378
00:17:05,180 --> 00:17:07,240
So, bring the dog back.
所以，把狗帶回來吧。

379
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:08,119
You're a hero.
你是一個英雄。

380
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:09,700
Yeah, I could be a hero.
是的，我可以成為英雄。

381
00:17:09,819 --> 00:17:10,440
I could do that.
我可以做到這一點。

382
00:17:10,859 --> 00:17:11,960
I could do that.
我可以做到這一點。

383
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:14,140
What if it attacks me?
如果它攻擊我怎麼辦？

384
00:17:15,579 --> 00:17:16,900
Yeah, that's like a big gerbil.
是的，就像一隻大沙鼠。

385
00:17:19,819 --> 00:17:21,839
And that doesn't scare you?
這並沒有嚇到你嗎？

386
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:28,160
Ross, you need some help?
羅斯，你需要幫忙嗎？

387
00:17:29,100 --> 00:17:29,880
From you?
從你那裡？

388
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:32,860
Yes, please.
是的，請。

389
00:17:39,210 --> 00:17:40,790
First of all, Utah?
首先，猶他州？

390
00:17:41,970 --> 00:17:43,890
Dude, you can't just make stuff up.
夥計，你不能胡編亂造。

391
00:17:48,510 --> 00:17:51,890
Okay, clunkers, come here, you big gerbil.
好吧，老傢伙們，過來，你這個大沙鼠。

392
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:55,110
Clunkers?
舊車？

393
00:17:56,570 --> 00:17:58,870
Where's my clunkers, my little clunkers?
我的舊車、我的小舊車在哪裡？

394
00:17:58,910 --> 00:18:02,090
No, no, no, I am not going to do that voice.
不，不，不，我不會發出那個聲音。

395
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:04,870
Clunkers?
舊車？

396
00:18:11,340 --> 00:18:13,820
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

397
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:16,360
Come back here, you furry little butt sniffer.
回來吧，你這個毛茸茸的小屁股嗅探者。

398
00:18:18,100 --> 00:18:19,140
Not you, ma'am.
不是你，女士。

399
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,440
I hate America.
我討厭美國。

400
00:18:24,940 --> 00:18:27,420
When I finish this game, I swear, I am moving.
當我完成這個遊戲時，我發誓，我要搬家了。

401
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:30,720
Hey.
嘿。

402
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:32,740
Peg, still talking to the police?
佩格，還在跟警察說話嗎？

403
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:33,160
Yeah.
是的。

404
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:35,880
Ah, why, damn it, why did I open my mouth?
啊，該死，我為什麼要張開嘴？

405
00:18:36,420 --> 00:18:37,420
I have a crush on you.
我迷戀你。

406
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:38,960
I am attracted to you.
我被你吸引了。

407
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:41,200
I mean, I know that I freaked him out.
我是說，我知道我嚇壞了他。

408
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:43,220
If you said it like that, you probably did, yeah.
如果你這麼說，你可能就這麼做了，是的。

409
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:46,180
What was I thinking?
我在想什麼？

410
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,640
I work with this man.
我和這個人一起工作。

411
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:49,760
I have to see him every day.
我每天都必須見到他。

412
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:51,280
How did this happen to me?
我怎麼會遇到這種事？

413
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:54,000
Oh, oh wait, that's right, it was because of you.
哦哦等等，沒錯，都是因為你。

414
00:18:56,840 --> 00:18:59,220
All right, all right, I think I can help you.
好吧好吧，我想我可以幫助你。

415
00:18:59,280 --> 00:19:00,380
You want to know what you have to do?
你想知道你必須做什麼嗎？

416
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:01,680
Please, help me.
請幫我。

417
00:19:01,740 --> 00:19:02,480
Okay, okay, okay.
好吧，好吧，好吧。

418
00:19:02,660 --> 00:19:06,080
