但相信我，瑞秋，這只會讓事情變得更糟。

421
00:19:09,860 --> 00:19:12,180
You have to deny everything.
你必須否認一切。

422
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:16,680
That conversation out there, never happened.
那裡的談話從未發生過。

423
00:19:17,760 --> 00:19:19,280
Joey, I don't think that's going to work.
喬伊，我認為這行不通。

424
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:21,320
It was a pretty long conversation.
這是一次相當長的談話。

425
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:23,260
Whoa, whoa, whoa, there was no conversation.
嗚嗚嗚，沒有對話。

426
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:27,780
Joey, I'm just going to talk to Tag.
喬伊，我要和塔格談談。

427
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:28,500
Who's Tag?
標籤是誰？

428
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:29,040
There's no Tag.
沒有標籤。

429
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:33,480
Okay, this conversation is over.
好了，本次對話就結束了。

430
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:35,160
See, it works.
看，它有效。

431
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:38,560
Was Chandler here?
錢德勒在嗎？

432
00:19:38,980 --> 00:19:41,060
No, no, he went for a walk.
不，不，他去散步了。

433
00:19:41,460 --> 00:19:43,880
Okay, well you cannot tell him, but look who's back.
好吧，你不能告訴他，但看看誰回來了。

434
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:44,960
Hi!
你好！

435
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:48,080
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

436
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:50,680
He went over to Ross's to bring the dog back here.
他去羅斯家把狗帶回來。

437
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:53,240
Oh, no, the dog's not going to be there.
哦，不，狗不會在那裡。

438
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:56,480
You think?
您認為？

439
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:05,300
Please, please, please, don't be mad at me.
拜託，拜託，拜託，不要生我的氣。

440
00:20:05,780 --> 00:20:06,060
What?
什麼？

441
00:20:06,520 --> 00:20:07,900
Why would she wait and see?
她為什麼要觀望？

442
00:20:07,900 --> 00:20:09,440
Maybe we will, maybe we won't.
也許我們會，也許我們不會。

443
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:14,400
Okay, I went over to Ross's apartment to bring back clunkers, you know,
好吧，我去羅斯的公寓帶回舊貨，你知道，

444
00:20:14,460 --> 00:20:14,900
for you.
為你。

445
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:19,860
And I left the door open and she must have gotten out.
我把門開著，她一定已經出去了。

446
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:24,840
And I looked everywhere, all over the apartment, including the roof.
我到處尋找，整個公寓，包括屋頂。

447
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:28,120
Which, FYI, Ross, one of your neighbors, growing weed.
僅供參考，羅斯，你的一位鄰居，正在種植雜草。

448
00:20:30,300 --> 00:20:31,840
I couldn't find them.
我找不到他們。

449
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:36,300
And I am so, so, so sorry.
我非常非常非常抱歉。

450
00:20:36,300 --> 00:20:40,360
But I do know where we can all go ease the pain.
但我確實知道我們可以去哪裡減輕痛苦。

451
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:45,020
We have good news.
我們有好訊息。

452
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:45,840
Look who's back!
看看誰回來了！

453
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:46,740
Hey!
嘿！

454
00:20:48,540 --> 00:20:49,640
Oh, my God!
我的天啊！

455
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:52,200
That's right, she came back all by herself.
沒錯，她是一個人回來的。

456
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,720
It's a Thanksgiving miracle!
這真是感恩節奇蹟！

457
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:59,760
It is so good to see you.
很高興見到你。

458
00:21:00,020 --> 00:21:02,120
Yes, she came all the way back from Ross's building.
是的，她從羅斯的大樓裡千里迢迢回來了。

459
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:04,420
Oh, the things she must have seen!
哦，她一定看過這些東西！

460
00:21:05,700 --> 00:21:08,760
And then she climbed up the fire escape, and she tapped on the
然後她爬上消防梯，敲擊

461
00:21:08,760 --> 00:21:11,920
window with her teeny little paw, and then we ran to let her
用她的小爪子開啟窗戶，然後我們跑去讓她

462
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:12,180
in.
在。

463
00:21:14,180 --> 00:21:15,640
I went too far, didn't I?
我太過分了，不是嗎？

464
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:18,240
When should I have stopped?
我什麼時候該停止？

465
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:28,680
Okay, maybe this is so hard because there aren't 50 states.
好吧，也許這很難，因為沒有 50 個州。

466
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:31,500
Let me tell you something.
讓我告訴你一件事。

467
00:21:31,500 --> 00:21:34,020
I have 49 states.
我有 49 個州。

468
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:35,940
And there are no more!
沒有更多了！

469
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:40,240
I think I should be able to eat something.
我想我應該可以吃點東西。

470
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:43,100
It's up to you.
由你決定。

471
00:21:47,340 --> 00:21:48,340
Oh, hi.
哦，嗨。

472
00:21:48,660 --> 00:21:49,500
How are you doing?
你好嗎？

473
00:21:50,100 --> 00:21:50,740
I'm okay.
我沒事。

474
00:21:51,120 --> 00:21:53,240
I gotta go down to the police station and look at mug shots.
我得去警察局看犯罪嫌疑人照片

475
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:55,760
Thanks for having me over, you guys.
謝謝你們邀請我過來。

476
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,000
Tag, you're going?
標籤，你要去嗎？

477
00:21:57,000 --> 00:22:00,960
We didn't even get a chance to talk.
我們連說話的機會都沒有。

478
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:03,540
So where did you say you're from again?
那你說你又從哪裡來？

479
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:04,380
Colorado.
科羅拉多州。

480
00:22:04,740 --> 00:22:05,460
Ah, what good are you?
啊，你有什麼好？

481
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:16,440
Look, I think we should talk about what happened on the terrace.
聽著，我想我們應該談談露臺上發生的事情。

482
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:17,060
Okay.
好的。

483
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:20,040
I never should have said what I said.
我根本不應該說出我所說的話。

484
00:22:20,300 --> 00:22:20,720
You know what?
你知道嗎？

485
00:22:20,740 --> 00:22:22,060
It just doesn't matter how I feel.
我的感受如何並不重要。

486
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:26,040
I mean, we work together, so nothing could really ever happen between us.
我的意思是，我們一起工作，所以我們之間不會發生任何事情。

487
00:22:26,040 --> 00:22:29,040
And what I would love is just to go to work on Monday
我所希望的是週一去上班

488
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:31,220
and never talk about this again.
並且永遠不再談論這件事。

489
00:22:31,940 --> 00:22:32,120
Okay?
好的？

490
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:33,320
Big day Monday.
週一是個大日子。

491
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:34,420
Lots to do.
有很多事情要做。

492
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:36,700
So are we okay?
那我們還好嗎？

493
00:22:37,540 --> 00:22:39,440
Um, I'm not.
嗯，我不是。

494
00:22:39,780 --> 00:22:40,660
Oh, God, I knew it.
哦，上帝，我就知道。

495
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:41,340
I freaked you out.
我嚇壞你了。

496
00:22:41,540 --> 00:22:42,620
No, you didn't.
不，你沒有。

497
00:22:43,420 --> 00:22:46,060
The only thing that freaked me out was you saying that nothing could
唯一讓我害怕的是你說沒有什麼可以

498
00:22:46,060 --> 00:22:47,180
ever happen between us.
我們之間曾經發生過。

499
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:49,100
Really?
真的嗎？

500
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:50,440
Yeah.
是的。

501
00:22:51,660 --> 00:22:54,220
So please don't fire me for doing this.
所以請不要因為我這樣做而解僱我。

502
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:07,240
Okay, well, that's one less thing we have to do on Monday.
好吧，這就是我們週一要做的少一件事。

503
00:23:29,380 --> 00:23:29,980
Delaware.
特拉華州。

504
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:35,040
Delaware.
特拉華州。

505
00:23:36,720 --> 00:23:37,100
Hi.
你好。

506
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:39,000
I want my turkey now.
我現在想要我的火雞。

507
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,140
You got it.
你明白了。

508
00:23:46,740 --> 00:23:48,480
You got Nevada twice.
你兩次獲得內華達州。

509
00:23:52,710 --> 00:23:53,250
I know.
我知道。

510
00:23:53,250 --> 00:23:53,670
Yeah.
是的。

